                            	   515: UpdateBlock_JumpTable:
02:00038464 00038470        	   516:     dc.l    UpdateBlock0Idle   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
02:00038468 0003854A        	   517:     dc.l    UpdateBlock1Moving   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
