02:00048064 00048078        	  4310:     dc.l    ReverseObjDir   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
02:00048068 0004807E        	  4311:     dc.l    Walker_AltDir_EndLoop   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
